WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.266
Hi! It's Saturday, and I'm at the street market. Let's go shopping!

2
00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:11.802
First, bananas. I want six bananas.

3
00:00:12.252 --> 00:00:17.036
Banana is countable: one banana, two bananas.

4
00:00:19.286 --> 00:00:22.397
Apples, too! An apple for me…

5
00:00:22.847 --> 00:00:25.262
…and some apples for my kids.

6
00:00:27.512 --> 00:00:30.902
And some carrots and tomatoes for the salad.

7
00:00:31.952 --> 00:00:36.039
Now, the bakery. Bread is uncountable.

8
00:00:36.489 --> 00:00:42.944
So I don't say "a bread". I say: a loaf of bread, please!

9
00:00:45.194 --> 00:00:48.584
At home, I have some milk and a cup of coffee.

10
00:00:49.034 --> 00:00:53.492
Milk and coffee are liquids, so they're uncountable.

11
00:00:55.742 --> 00:00:58.389
And you? What's your favorite fruit?

